  "process": "FDM 3D printing",
  "design_notes": "Hub adapts a servo's 4-hole spline-horn screw pattern (sketch1, holes at \u00b17mm) to a goBILDA 12mm ReX hex shaft. Assumptions: corner screw clearance 2.8mm (M2.5), hex bore across-flats = shaft_af + 0.15mm slip clearance, set-screw is an M3 self-tap (2.5mm pilot) aimed at a hex flat for axial retention only \u2014 torque is carried by the hex fit. Process: FDM 3D print.",
